@VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Every vehicle make
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes
Accept: application/json

### Vehicle types for a known make (448 = Honda)
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/448/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

### Unknown make — expect 200 with an empty array, not a 404
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/999999/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

### Malformed id — expect 404 from the route constraint, no handler involved
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/abc/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

###
